g at all."}, {"start": 20.443, "end": 21.584, "text": "I feel completely normal."}, {"start": 22.305, "end": 23.286, "text": "No symptoms then."}, {"start": 23.886, "end": 26.168, "text": "Your body mass index is 29."}, {"start": 27.029, "end": 27.85, "text": "What does that number mean?"}, {"start": 28.766, "end": 31.348, "text": "It compares your weight with your height."}, {"start": 31.408, "end": 33.249, "text": "29 is above the healthy range."}, {"start": 34.11, "end": 34.43, "text": "Alright."}, {"start": 35.371, "end": 39.113, "text": "Your fasting blood sugar was 7.0 millimoles per liter."}, {"start": 39.753, "end": 43.496, "text": "Your long-term sugar value was 47 millimoles per mole."}, {"start": 44.357, "end": 44.997, "text": "Is that high?"}, {"start": 45.657, "end": 47.018, "text": "I do not know much about these things."}, {"start": 47.999, "end": 49.24, "text": "Both are above normal."}, {"start": 49.68, "end": 52.742, "text": "Together, they raise a suspicion of type 2 diabetes."}, {"start": 54.263, "end": 54.924, "text": "Diabetes."}, {"start": 55.404, "end": 56.005, "text": "So I have it?"}, {"start": 56.905, "end": 58.046, "text": "It is not confirmed."}, {"start": 58.642, "end": 59.663, "text": "It is a suspicion."}, {"start": 60.403, "end": 62.625, "text": "Further tests have been arranged to settle it."}, {"start": 63.445, "end": 64.706, "text": "And those will tell us for certain?"}, {"start": 65.526, "end": 66.987, "text": "That is why they are being done."}, {"start": 67.668, "end": 69.709, "text": "Nothing changes for you until we have them."}, {"start": 70.629, "end": 71.73, "text": "Okay, I understand."}, {"start": 72.591, "end": 72.871, "text": "Good."}, {"start": 73.591, "end": 75.172, "text": "You had the holiday off, I take it."}, {"start": 75.733, "end": 76.973, "text": "It is only just finished."}, {"start": 77.974, "end": 80.796, "text": "Yes, it was quiet and nice, but it went by fast."}, {"start": 81.836, "end": 82.737, "text": "They always do."}, {"start": 83.798, "end": 84.998, "text": "Anything else you want to ask?"}, {"start": 86.039, "end": 87.12, "text": "No, thank you, doctor."}, {"start": 87.16, "end": 87.5, "text": "Goodbye."}], "machine": "gpu59.int.triton.aalto.fi", "git_commit": "735eed3a1a4f5d8bc8a3ac1f1c8897e291443b9f", "date": "2026-09-20", "timing_s": {"transcribe_and_align": 1.683}}